# Database credentials -- Secret misp-db. Set them in the chart's secrets.db value, or map
# an operator's Secret onto DB_USER and DB_PASSWORD with the connectionSecrets value.
# Consumers: configure and its migrate container, web, worker, the task CronJobs, metrics
# (user and password only), org-sync, the postgres component, housekeeping.
DB_USER=misp
DB_PASSWORD=change-me
